      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "此處只寫與臉部描述相關的提示詞，和整體照片品質的提示詞。\n可使用人物lora。\n某些圖片可能會無法辨識臉部，導致\"FaceDetailer\"的功能失效。 可以嘗試重新啟動comfyui。\nFaceDetailer功能本身有bug，有些圖片可能無法讀取到人物面部會導致黑畫面。\n上傳的圖片過大時會導致顯示卡記憶體不足。\n\nThis section only includes prompts related to facial descriptions and overall photo quality.\nThe character Lora can be used.\nSome images may fail to recognize faces, causing the \"FaceDetailer\" function to malfunction.\nYou can try restarting comfyui. The \"FaceDetailer\" feature itself has a bug; it may fail to read faces in some images, resulting in a black screen.\nUploading images that are too large can cause insufficient memory on the graphics card."
      ],
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
